  "projectUrl": "https://ziplogger.ai/",
  "published": "2026-10-08T21:40:44.59Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Product analytics: ZipLoggerShipper now also implements IEventTracker — Track(\"checkout_started\", new { ... }) and Identify(userId, anonymousId) ship events to /ingest/v1/events on their own buffered channel (async, batched, retried, never throws). AmbientSession.Begin(...) stamps a session id on everything tracked in scope; events default their requestId from Activity.Current so they correlate with logs and traces. Existing logging APIs are unchanged.",
